# Command Example Placement

- When the user asks for a command example to be written in code comments, place it at the very bottom of the target file.
- Do not place that command example at the top or middle of the file.
- Preserve existing code behavior; only add/update trailing comments for the command example.
- For PyInstaller examples in this project, keep the command in comment form at file end.
- Default icon filename should match EXE name (e.g., `--name "LogExpert"` with `--icon="LogExpert.ico"`).
